      "text": "1.sort(cookies)\n2. sort(children)\n3 i = 0 //cookies = N\n4. j = 0 ,, children = M\n\nint ans = 0;\nwhile(i< len(c) && j < len(child){\n    if(cookies[i]>=childre[j]){\n        ans++;\n        i++;\n        j++;\n    }else{\n        i++;\n    }\n}\nreturn ans;",
